WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.360
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:13.700
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.330
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.830
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.420
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.050
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.640
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:40.310
by ridding you...

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.480
...of your other love?

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:48.060
At sunset,

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.610
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.530
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:58.410
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.490
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:04.290
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.800
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.350
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.850
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:32.110 --> 00:01:35.280
I'm Kurata Sana,
a 6th grader and TV personality.

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:37.780
My beloved Mama,
an Aoki-award winning novelist.

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:39.320
The chipmunk on her head is Maro-chan.

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:41.120
My former boyfriend, Sagami Rei-kun.

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:44.000
Right now, he's racing
to be a great manager.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:45.660
The mysterious white bat straight man.

00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:48.960
I'm Babbit! Huh? My voice sounds funny?
It's just your imagination!

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:52.630
Hayama Akito, my natural enemy,
and good friend.

00:01:52.630 --> 00:01:54.920
Kamura Naozumi-kun.
He's a Bishonen TV personality,

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:57.510
who hails from Kamura Academy,
just like I did.

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:03.470
"Could Be a Small-Size Hayama"

00:02:12.770 --> 00:02:14.650
The issue with Mama has been settled,

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:16.570
and I'm finally back to my normal life.

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:18.240
And then, one day...

00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:19.200
"Set your sights!
Inter-Show Hidden Talent
Competition Victory! ¥1,000,000 prize!"

00:02:19.450 --> 00:02:21.450
Sana-chan, telephone for you.

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:22.450
Oinkie?

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:24.790
Yes, it's from Naozumi-kun.

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:29.120
Oinkie-oinkie? Oink?
Oinkie-oink-oinkie? Oink-oink-oinkie!

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:32.380
Sana-chan, I'm surprised
you can converse like that.

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:34.710
I finally got a call from Naozumi-kun.

00:02:34.710 --> 00:02:39.050
Hey, Rei-kun, unless you translate
for us, the story won't move forward.

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:40.050
Me!?

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:42.390
"Huh? Kamura Academy? Right now?"

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:46.060
"Sure, I'll come! Okay, see you out
in front of the TV station's front door."

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:48.390
But what about the taping!?

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:51.730
Listen, Uchiyamada,
puhformance is awl about spirit.

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:54.230
Above awl, you've got to let go
of yourself, and fight with spirit.

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:55.070
Got that?

00:02:55.070 --> 00:02:58.070
"Zenjiro-san!"

00:02:58.070 --> 00:02:59.740
What is it, Sana-chan?
Something the mattuh?

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:02.070
"Zenjiro-san, do you have any loves?"

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:05.080
Well, shua, more than
I can hold onto, awl ovuh!

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:07.580
"That's because you're a nice person,

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:10.080
who wouldn't turn down a cute girl
asking you for a favor, right?"

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:11.750
Aw, you're too much!

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:14.750
"That's my Zenjiro-san!
You can always count on him!"

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:16.420
Aw, you've really got me now!

00:03:16.420 --> 00:03:19.420
Okay then, that takes care of it!

00:03:19.420 --> 00:03:21.010
--Whut just happened?
--Whut just happened?

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:23.430
She skipped out of work, that's whut.

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:24.760
Let's go.

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:27.100
Okay then, I'm off.

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:29.430
I'm not really too sure about this...

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:31.560
Strike while the iron is hot!

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:34.400
They say that your lucky day
is the best day for a date!

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:35.730
I'm not too sure about this...

00:03:35.730 --> 00:03:37.400
It's too late to be jealous now.

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:41.490
"Rei-kun stays home worrying"

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:39.570
Rei-kun stays home worrying.

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:41.490
Is it okay for her to be skipping work?

00:03:42.070 --> 00:03:45.410
I've always wanted to
go see Kamura Academy,

00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:48.750
so I wound up letting
Naozumi-kun take me.

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:51.290
You good boys and girls,
don't stick your head out the window.

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:56.090
Oh, sorry, I can't help
but make a big deal out of this.

00:03:56.090 --> 00:03:58.760
That's okay. It must be a long time
since you've gotten away, huh?

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:03.430
That's right, sir.
I am a very busy person.

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:08.430
I'd like to thank him for what
he did earlier, but how do I bring it up?

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:10.430
I won't say anything about Sana-chan.

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:14.100
I ask you to please
leave Sana-chan alone.

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:18.110
"Thanks for doing that for my sake,"
would sound weird somehow.

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:21.110
Aw, this is kind of awkward.
I'm not used to this sort of thing.

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:24.110
I'd sound like I was stuck-up.
How embarrassing...

00:04:24.110 --> 00:04:25.780
Something wrong, Sana-chan?

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:27.450
No. Umm...

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:29.790
I heard you've met your birth mother.

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:33.790
Yeah, that's right. I was surprised
at how easily she came forward,

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:35.040
once the book came out.

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:38.130
That just shows you how much
she's been watching you,

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:39.710
Sana-chan... the things you've been doing,

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.710
and your mother's books, and all.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:45.720
That must be it. Naozumi-kun, don't you
ever feel like looking for your parents?

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:48.350
Nope. As far as parents and family goes,

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:50.720
I've got plenty of them
at Kamura Academy, after all.

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:53.390
I don't have time to miss them.

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:54.730
I guess not.

00:04:54.730 --> 00:04:59.730
Oh, yeah. Some of those family are really
looking forward to you coming, Sana-chan.

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:02.820
Oh!? In that case, Sana-chan,
with her great sense of service,

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:04.400
can't very well show up empty-handed!

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:05.740
What is it, Sana-chan?

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:10.740
Ta-da! This brand-new item! It's essential
for girls who value communication.

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:13.750
I'll set the rhythm to a
nori-nori Kodocha pattern...

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:16.080
As long as I have this, I'm going
to double the number of friends I have!

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:17.750
What is that thing, Sana-chan?

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:19.750
The composing machine, Nopia.

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:22.760
Composing machine?

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:25.760
Sorry about this. It's going
to be a little bit bumpy.

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:30.430
There's no "little bit" about it!
Where in the world are you driving!?

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:33.720
I'm having him select
the most scenic route to take.

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:35.350
I'm glad you're enjoying it.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:38.690
Never mind the scenery, I'm trying
to double the number of friends I have!

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:40.400
Do-fa-la-so-do-do-do-do!

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:42.690
Well, we're almost there, Sana-chan!

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:45.780
Do-la-fa-la fa-la-so-la mi-do-re-mi-do!

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:50.410
Hey, is Sana-chan really coming with him?

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:52.080
Is Sana-chan coming, too?

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:54.080
Yes. It's almost time for them to arrive.

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:57.120
Everyone, Sana-chan is coming!
Hurry, hurry!

00:05:58.040 --> 00:06:02.090
Ko-chan, hurry, hurry! Come on up!

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:03.710
Aw, shut up.

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:06.380
Ah, they're here, they're here!

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:09.050
I'm getting so excited! I wonder
if I can get her to shake my hand!

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:11.550
Now, now, calm down, everyone.

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:18.730
Okay, I'll come pick you up later.

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:20.440
Okay, thanks!

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:24.110
Naozumi-kun, do you commute
like that every day?

00:06:24.110 --> 00:06:27.450
This path... this feeling...

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:29.700
I shouldn't remember this place at all,

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:32.370
and yet somehow,
it's all terribly familiar.

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:35.700
For some reason, I'm so excited...

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:38.040
Something wrong, Sana-chan?

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:42.380
Uh- er... Those people from Wideshow
came here over that thing earlier, right?

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:45.050
I was just thinking how that
must have put everyone out here.

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:48.050
I'm the one who
brought up Kamura Academy.

00:06:48.050 --> 00:06:51.050
It's okay, it's okay,
you don't have to worry.

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:55.060
Is that right? Maybe I'm the
only one who is all wound up.

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:57.060
--It's okay, it's okay,

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:59.730
--you don't have to worry!

00:06:59.730 --> 00:07:02.730
--Wow! It's really her!

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:06.400
Everyone, calm down, calm down!
Calm down!

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:08.400
My goodness, welcome!

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:11.410
Thank you for coming
all this way to see us.

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:16.080
This is the director, Kamura-sensei.
She is everyone's mother.

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:17.410
N- nice to meet you.

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:20.870
Or rather, I don't remember it at all,
but when I was little,

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:22.420
I understand that you
took care of me for a month.

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:25.420
That's right.
You've become a fine older sister.

00:07:25.420 --> 00:07:28.090
Nah, I wouldn't go that far!

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:29.340
--I've gotten so I can do this...

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:34.010
--and this... and this!

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:35.350
--Director, do we look like her?

00:07:35.350 --> 00:07:36.350
--Do we look like her?

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:39.020
My, my, just like her!

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:40.020
I'm Mika!

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:41.020
I'm Yui!

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:44.360
I'm Namuro Amie-- I'm Ayumi.

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:46.690
--We are the Sannas!

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:49.690
They all want to be like you, Sana-chan.

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:51.030
Sannas...?

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:53.360
--Sana-chan, shake our hands!

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:54.370
--Shake our hands!

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:59.370
Okay, all of you get a handshake,
as my present to you! Line up, line up!

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:02.790
Everyone line up nice,
so there's no fighting.

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:08.050
Hey! No sooner do I say that, when who
is that over there starting a fight!?

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:09.960
Hey! You there!

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:14.090
What kind of defiant little kid is this!?

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:16.390
In one instant, he calls to mind
a certain former boss monkey.

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:18.060
But on closer look, he's really
a cute little kid, isn't he?

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:20.390
Here, do you want to shake my hand, too?

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:22.060
What's with this kid!?

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:24.400
Not so cute after all...

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:27.730
I'm sorry for all the hullabaloo
so soon after you got here.

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:30.480
The little children watch TV, you see,

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:33.030
and think of you as
their older sister, Sana-chan.

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:38.030
Still, I was surprised at the Sannas.
It almost sounds like a monster.

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:41.700
For what it's worth, I play as Kamurra.

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:43.710
You don't resemble him one bit.

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:45.710
Hey, Atsushi, don't barge in!

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:47.590
--Big Brother Nao, we need to get

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:49.050
--Sana-chan's reception party ready!

00:08:49.050 --> 00:08:50.050
Not you, too!

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:51.380
Reception?

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:55.720
Sorry for all the hullabaloo, but when I
told them that Sana-chan would be coming,

00:08:55.720 --> 00:09:00.060
everyone got all excited, and said they
were going to throw a reception for you.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:02.390
Wow, I don't know what to say.
This is kind of embarrassing.

00:09:02.390 --> 00:09:05.060
Okay, I'll come help out.

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:08.060
This is Naozumi-kun when he was little?

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:10.610
Nao-chan will be upset at me
for telling you this,

00:09:10.610 --> 00:09:13.070
but when he was little,
he was so spoiled.

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:16.410
Yeah? Naozumi-kun, huh?

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:20.080
--Waah! I want a papa and mama, too!
--Sensei, Nao-chan is crying again!

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:24.410
Nao-chan, that girl is going to
laugh at you if all you do is cry.

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:29.090
This is Sana-chan's ambush report!
So, where are we today?

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:34.050
Ta-da! This is the first public showing
of Zenjiro-san's Tokyo girlfriend's house!

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:36.010
All joking aside,

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:38.010
--Sana-chan, your jokes are hawsh!
--That girl was here together with you,
Nao-chan.

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:39.010
--Ta-da! This is the first public showing!
--That girl was here together with you,
Nao-chan.

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:40.350
--What foist public showing!?
--Huh? You're kidding.

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:42.680
--Zenjiro-san's Osaka girlfriend's house!
--Look, here you are in the same picture.

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:45.020
--How lawng are you going
to kid around, Sana-chan?
--That's Sana-chan and Nao-chan.

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:48.520
--Then, your girlfriend must be in Nagoya!
--She doesn't have a papa or mama, either.

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:50.690
--It's not Tokyo, or Osaka, or Nagoya!
--And yet, look at how cheerful she is.

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:54.030
--Zenjiro-san, you're so naive.
--Sensei, I want to do

00:09:54.030 --> 00:09:56.700
--Sana-chan, you really are hawsh!
Your questions are so leading!
--the same kind of work as Sana-chan.

00:09:56.700 --> 00:10:01.700
My, my, I'm not sure you can, Nao-chan.
Crybabies aren't able to do it.

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:05.370
I won't cry anymore. I won't cry.

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:10.380
It was right at that time that Nao-chan
was scouted by a child talent agency,

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:16.010
I took the plunge and let him
give it a try. I tell him it's okay now,

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:18.380
but he still gives me some of his wages.

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:20.390
Isn't that nice of him?

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:26.430
So you see, Nao-chan became such a fine
older brother thanks to you, Sana-chan.

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:30.730
I was just goofing around!

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:33.650
Wow, amazing, amazing!
They're going all-out.

00:10:33.650 --> 00:10:36.030
We're having a fancy barbecue, too!

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:38.950
Oh, meat!? Yay! I love it!
I love it! Meat, meat, meat, meat!

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:40.700
It's even delicious raw!
Meat, meat, meat, meat!

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:45.950
Sorry for all the hullabaloo. Sana-chan,
especially for you, it's all-you-can-eat!

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:50.000
Help yourself to
as much of whatever you like.

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:52.380
There's... no meat, huh?

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:56.670
"Welcome home, Sana-chan"

00:10:52.380 --> 00:10:54.670
--Welcome home...

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:56.670
--Sana-chan!

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:58.340
Welcobe hobe?

00:10:58.340 --> 00:11:02.090
Everyone knows that
you came from here, Sana-chan,

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:05.100
and everyone thinks of this
as their home, and all...

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:07.350
I ged id.

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:11.400
I guess dat's drue.
Id's like a hobe to be, doo.

00:11:11.400 --> 00:11:12.400
Mm-hmm.

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:15.690
Well, that makes us like
brother and sister, huh Naozumi-kun?

00:11:15.690 --> 00:11:17.740
No... I wouldn't say that...

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:21.700
Come to mention it, Naozumi-kun,
I hear you acted like a spoiled kid.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:23.410
Sensei told you, huh!?

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:26.080
--Sana-chan, sing!

00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:27.750
Me?

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:31.040
Well, this is all so sudden...

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:34.000
You composed something for
this occasion, didn't you?

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:38.760
The rhythm is a
nori-nori Kodocha pattern.

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:41.720
♪ Oh! I've come, come, come here,
come to the sea. ♪

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:45.100
♪ I've crossed the mountains
and crossed the valleys to be here. ♪

00:11:45.100 --> 00:11:48.390
♪ But the barbecue didn't have any meat!
Oh, well. ♪

00:11:48.390 --> 00:11:51.730
♪ Sana-chan is touched at this reception. ♪

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:54.730
♪ And so, as Sana-chan's present, ♪

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:58.110
♪ this is Sana-chan's first composition! ♪

00:11:58.110 --> 00:11:59.360
If you step on your Nopia,
it will break,

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:01.070
so don't try this at home,
you good boys and girls!

00:12:01.070 --> 00:12:04.070
♪ --Hello, Margarita, dongara-tan-tan. ♪
--My, such a hullabaloo!

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:07.410
♪ --Oh, my sweet home is right here! ♪
--Is that the only thing you can say?

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:12.410
♪ I don't remember it,
but there's no place like home! ♪

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:16.420
Oh, my god! What is this! What is this!?
Why!? What an incredible reception!

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:19.090
Who is causing this mischief!?

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:22.680
Ko-chan! Ko-chan, you're the one
who's doing this, aren't you!?

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:30.810
Hey, it's you again!
Playing with fire makes you wet the bed!

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:31.980
--Yeah! Yeah!

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:34.310
--You shouldn't point fireworks at people!

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:41.240
Ko-chan! You mustn't hit girls!

00:12:42.070 --> 00:12:46.070
Don't go strutting around,
just because you're on TV.

00:12:46.070 --> 00:12:48.410
S- strutting around...?

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:49.740
You're annoying.

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:53.410
A- annoying...?

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:56.080
That stare... that defiant attitude...

00:12:56.080 --> 00:13:00.210
This kid is the spitting image of Hayama!

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:14.890
This kid is the spitting image of Hayama!

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:18.610
What kind of nonsense are you babbling,
you hag?

00:13:18.610 --> 00:13:19.610
What!?

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:22.650
My, "hag" is not a word you
would use on a young 6th-grader,

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:24.950
like myself, you silly.

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:27.610
You forever continue to be annoying,
you hag.

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:31.290
Easy, easy, easy... He's got me
lowering myself to his level.

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.500
If I let myself be beaten
by this little boy,

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:35.870
then the great star Kurata Sana-chan
will completely lose face.

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:38.130
Now, what do
you mean by "annoying"?

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:40.090
Your big sister here doesn't
understand what you mean.

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:43.880
If you don't know,
then look it up for yourself, Auntie.

00:13:43.880 --> 00:13:47.550
Whoa, it's a dictionary! Is he
trying to make a fool of me!?

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:51.560
Easy, easy, easy... at this rate,
I'm going to lose any chance of recovery.

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:53.020
Unless I show him
that I'm a mature woman,

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:56.560
this little boy's going to take
ever greater advantage of me.

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:58.850
Okay, let's have a look.

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:01.570
"Annoying"..."annoying"..."annoying"...
"Annoying" is an adjective.

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:04.440
Here, you can also write it
as "May fly." I knew that.

00:14:04.440 --> 00:14:05.570
Zenjiro-san told me.

00:14:05.570 --> 00:14:09.530
So, is that it? Fly?
Are you saying that I am a fly?

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:13.910
That's right.

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:17.500
You're calling me a fly, huh?
You just called me a fly, huh?

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:19.580
Well, I will admit that I am a little
more full of zip than other people...

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:22.920
--Okay, everyone, the cake is done!
--Okay, everyone, the cake is done!

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:25.590
--Sana-chan, you go first!

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:29.930
Huh? Cake!? Yay! I love it! I love it!
I love it! I love it! Cake! Cake! Cake!

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:32.430
It's even delicious raw!
Cake! Cake! Cake!

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:38.940
Thank you, thank you.

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:42.900
Dummy! Let the fly eat it!

00:14:42.900 --> 00:14:43.900
Hey, Koji!

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:48.900
My, my, I'm sorry for all the hullabaloo.
Sensei wanted some, too.

00:14:48.900 --> 00:14:52.490
Sorry, Sana-chan. He's kind at heart,
but not very well-behaved.

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:54.910
He isn't really a bad boy.

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:56.660
That tears it.

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:00.580
What was that, Sana-chan?

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:03.250
That completely tears it!

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:04.590
He's Mini-Hayama!

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:06.260
He is absolutely Mini-Hayama!

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:08.920
I'm going to make him say "Uncle!"

00:15:08.920 --> 00:15:11.590
"I heard the neighbors put up
a fence around their house."

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:12.590
"That's fancy ('fence-y')."

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:14.600
"Oh, Uncle..."

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:15.930
That's stupid.

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:20.270
Hey! You shouldn't be reading the books!
Buy them first, then you can read them.

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:22.600
Akito-kun, what are you reading?

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:23.610
Nothing.

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:24.610
That car...!

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:27.610
Did you get the Polaroid camera?
And don't forget to buy film!

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:29.280
I bought it, I bought it.

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:31.610
Are you sure you didn't forget
to put in the bungee jump set

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:32.530
and the super-strong vacuum cleaner!?

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:34.200
Yeah, I packed them, I packed them!

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:35.870
Okay, come quick!
Hurry, come quick! Come right away!

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:37.200
Okay, okay, okay, okay!

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:38.870
We sure would like to go for a drive.

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:41.210
Sorry, I don't have time
to entertain you right now.

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:42.790
Rei-kun! Who are you talking to!?

00:15:42.790 --> 00:15:43.960
Hurry! Hurry! Are you driving!?

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:46.550
--Say, are you driving!?
--I'm driving!

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:47.880
Drives sure are fun.

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:50.050
Rei-kun! What are you
dawdling around for!?

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:51.220
You can't be poking along right now!

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:53.550
For the first time in my life,
I'm driving all-out!

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:55.220
Hey, hey, obey the traffic laws!

00:15:55.220 --> 00:15:57.220
Get here in three seconds!
Got that!? You have to!

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:59.890
Three seconds, did you say!?

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:01.230
Three!

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:02.230
Two!

00:16:02.230 --> 00:16:03.310
One!

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:06.570
We made it...!

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:09.230
We made it, all right.

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:10.860
"Battle with Ko-chan!"

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:10.900
Sure is handy, being an anime.

00:16:10.900 --> 00:16:14.570
Okay, Ko-chan! I challenge
you to a bungee jump contest!

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:17.240
Whoever's voice is the
loudest loses this contest!

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:20.250
Whoever said I was going to do this?

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:23.500
You're afraid of high places, huh?
Just as I suspected!

00:16:23.500 --> 00:16:25.580
That's right!
I've found out your weakness!

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:27.920
You want me to cry uncle?

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:31.510
Of course I do! Your type
needs to be made to say "Uncle,"

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:33.180
or you'll never behave yourself.

00:16:33.180 --> 00:16:35.550
"I heard the neighbors put up
a fence around their house."

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:36.510
"That's fancy."

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:38.890
"Oh, Uncle..."

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:40.520
There, I said it.

00:16:40.520 --> 00:16:43.190
You're every bit like Hayama.

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:44.560
Who is Hayama?

00:16:44.560 --> 00:16:46.650
The one who looks like this! See? See?

00:16:46.650 --> 00:16:48.520
You've got the exact
same ill-humored mouth as him!

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:51.190
Sana-chan, you don't have to get
so worked up over a little boy--

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:52.860
Rei-kun, you keep quiet.

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:54.860
--Okay.
--Now, now, Sana-chan,

00:16:54.860 --> 00:16:58.530
we don't have any trees that are
just right for bungee jumping around here.

00:16:58.530 --> 00:17:02.040
There's that one there!

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:12.210
How tall is that?

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:14.880
Was that tree there a minute ago?

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:15.880
What's more,

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:19.930
it has a beacon light to let
aircraft know how tall it is!

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:21.930
--Sana-chan, good luck!

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:24.890
My, Sana-chan, what a hullabaloo.

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:28.940
Director, is that
the only thing you can say?

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:31.940
Hasn't she forgotten about something?

00:17:31.940 --> 00:17:35.860
Earlier, she forgot
that we even existed.

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:38.530
Okay, here I go!

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:40.870
Wow, how high, how high!

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:43.120
"Kamura Academy"

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:43.160
This feels so good!

00:17:46.210 --> 00:17:50.210
She may be fine with heights,
but she has trouble with falling.

00:17:50.210 --> 00:17:51.550
What is she, an idiot?

00:17:51.550 --> 00:17:53.210
Yeah. She's an idiot.

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:56.470
Sure enough, I am an idiot!

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:03.220
This week's Sana-chan. Can you see her?

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:04.560
How about that?

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:05.890
What are you, an idiot?

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:07.810
Hey! Hold it!

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:10.810
She's an idiot, all right.

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:16.900
Miserable Mini-Hayama! I'll just move
on to my next technique at below cost!

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:19.240
Sana-chan, enough.

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:22.910
No way! If all of us here are family,
then he's like a younger brother to me!

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:25.910
Sana-chan, him being
your brother is fine and all,

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:29.920
but I don't think of you as
being my sister, Sana-chan.

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:32.840
--After all, I consider you--
--Uh-oh, he's gone off
into his own little world.

00:18:32.840 --> 00:18:35.510
--Are you going to make me say the rest?
--Then again, that's a good thing,
huh Akito-kun?

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:37.670
--There is a gentle breeze between us.
--It looks like Sana-chan is
more concerned about that other boy

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:38.840
--It's sparkling, see?
--than she is Naozumi-kun, huh?

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:40.510
Whatever.

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:42.850
Come! Feel the breeze!

00:18:42.850 --> 00:18:45.220
This sparkling breeze!

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:48.520
--Big Brother Nao is falling apart!

00:18:48.520 --> 00:18:50.810
--Kamurra won't be left behind!

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:53.520
--He's falling apart, too!
--He's falling apart, too!
--Life sure is lots of fun, isn't it?

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:55.530
Hey, hold up!

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:57.900
When are you going to
get off my back, Auntie!?

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:00.860
Let me go, Auntie!

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:02.870
I can see right through your weakness!

00:19:02.870 --> 00:19:04.330
I can tell that you're
the type who is proud,

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:05.870
and doesn't want people to
see you in an embarrassing way.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:07.540
Power up!

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:12.880
Don't you look cool now,
exposed little boy?

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:14.250
I took it! I took it!

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:17.210
That thing which is unspeakable
by young maidens has come out!

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:20.300
Look here, look here,
if you want me to return this to you,

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:21.220
you'll have to behave yourself!

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:22.550
Look here, look here!

00:19:22.550 --> 00:19:23.550
W- what...?

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:25.890
If you want to see it, take a look.

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:29.230
I guess boys around this age
don't have any sense of shame, huh?

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:30.890
Nope, don't have it.

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:33.770
Geez, if you've got something to say,
then spell it out.

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:35.520
Let's split our butts already.

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:39.860
You just saw it, right?
My butt is already split.

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:42.860
Come to mention it, that was
exactly like what Hayama said.

00:19:42.860 --> 00:19:44.870
Who is Hayama?

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:46.870
Like I said before,

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:48.870
he's the one who looks like that!

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:52.540
See? See? You've got the exact
same ill-humored mouth as him!

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:53.880
Hayama, when did you get here?

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:58.210
You're just now noticing?
Same old airhead as ever.

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:01.880
Who are you?

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:05.550
Oh, here it comes, here it comes!
The original Hayama lays the smack down!

00:20:05.550 --> 00:20:06.890
Go! Go! Go! Talk smack to him!

00:20:06.890 --> 00:20:09.600
But I won't have any violence.
This is supposed to be an anime

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:11.230
that good little boys and girls
can look up to, after all.

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:12.890
Really?

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:15.900
What did I just tell you!?

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:18.230
Ee-yow! What are you doing!?

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:19.230
Kid...

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:20.900
What!?

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:24.240
If you've got something to say, say it.

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:26.910
What's this now? You really do
have something to say, don't you?

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:30.580
If you store up things that you want to
say inside you, you'll get constipated.

00:20:30.580 --> 00:20:33.710
We're like family here, right?

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:39.500
Darn it!

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:42.170
Hey! Didn't you hear what I said!?

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:43.680
Hey...

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:49.180
Hey! Are you playing with fire again!?

00:20:49.180 --> 00:20:52.850
Oh, my god! What is this! What is this?!
Why?! Another fireworks attack!?

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:54.850
Oh, so that's it!

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:56.860
Here I was, wondering
where Sana-chan went,

00:20:56.860 --> 00:20:58.190
and it turns out she's
playing around something royal.

00:20:58.190 --> 00:21:00.530
I'll put these things out! I'll put these
things out! I'll put these things out!

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:02.190
Don't put them out!

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:03.860
--Just come with me.
--What? What?

00:21:03.860 --> 00:21:05.860
Hayama, you badgering,
ecchi-ing, sketching, letch!

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:07.530
Look.

00:21:07.530 --> 00:21:09.280
Over there.

00:21:12.200 --> 00:21:13.540
"Sana-chan..."

00:21:13.540 --> 00:21:16.210
"Wel--"

00:21:16.210 --> 00:21:17.540
"Sana-chan, wel--?"

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:19.210
"--come."

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:22.550
Is that right? I don't know what to say!

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:23.880
So that's it.

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:27.220
He wanted to greet Sana-chan
in a different way from everyone else.

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:29.550
What do you know, he's even
more mannerly than Akito-kun.

00:21:29.550 --> 00:21:31.220
Shut up.

00:21:31.220 --> 00:21:33.060
It's been quite a hullabaloo,

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:36.100
but let's try having the
reception again at the beach!

00:21:36.900 --> 00:21:37.900
I'm Mika!

00:21:37.900 --> 00:21:41.900
--I'm Yui!
--I'm Suehiro Ruriko-- I'm Ayumi.

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:44.240
--We are the Sannas!

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:45.900
♪ It was a spiteful performance, ♪

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:47.910
♪ "Sana-chan, welcome!" it said? ♪

00:21:47.910 --> 00:21:49.910
♪ --It's making me, making me,
making me cry. ♪
--Sure it wasn't "Sana-chan is irritating"?

00:21:49.910 --> 00:21:51.910
♪ Hey, you, hey, you, what was that? ♪

00:21:51.910 --> 00:21:54.250
♪ --You don't behave yourself, either. ♪
--Stop.

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:56.250
♪ Good grief, it's hard to tell
if Akito-kun and Sana-chan... ♪

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:58.250
♪ ...get along well,
or get along poorly. ♪

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:00.250
♪ --Big Brother Nao is falling apart. ♪

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:02.250
♪ Jan-jan-jan-jan, falling apart. ♪

00:22:02.250 --> 00:22:04.260
♪ --Big Brother Nao is falling apart. ♪

00:22:04.260 --> 00:22:07.930
♪ Falling apart, falling apart. ♪
--Kamurra won't be left behind!

00:22:07.930 --> 00:22:12.260
--Thanks for coming along today, Hayama.
You got to meet all of my family.
--Let go.

00:22:12.260 --> 00:22:14.770
--I'm glad I skipped work for this.
--Let go, I said.

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:21.650
Maybe I should just quit my job.

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:42.290
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:47.800
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:49.050 --> 00:22:52.550
In dire straits,

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:56.140
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:00.020
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.980 --> 00:23:05.070
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:11.110
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.360 --> 00:23:13.330
...panic!!

00:23:14.330 --> 00:23:19.160
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:21.880
he's there.

00:23:22.790 --> 00:23:25.130
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.710
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:30.220
...for two.

00:23:31.090 --> 00:23:33.720
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:38.430
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.390 --> 00:23:42.060
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:46.730
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:52.320
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:54.990
he's there,

00:23:55.950 --> 00:23:58.160
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:00.790
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.910 --> 00:24:03.290
...for two.

00:24:07.800 --> 00:24:10.800
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:13.130
Retirement! Retirement!
I'm declaring retirement!

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:14.840
No matter what happens, I'm retiring!

00:24:14.840 --> 00:24:18.520
I want to retire, and that's that.
I'm going to play a little bit now!

00:24:18.520 --> 00:24:21.180
Sana is going to
become a normal girl again,

00:24:21.180 --> 00:24:22.190
from anyone's viewpoint.

00:24:22.190 --> 00:24:26.440
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha, Episode 22 of
the Love and Respect for Maidens and Men Saga:

00:24:26.440 --> 00:24:31.110
Heart of Karate and
Announcement of Retirement

00:24:31.110 --> 00:24:35.450
You can retire, but becoming a
normal girl might be asking too much.
